          "en": "OpenAI has open-sourced Symphony, an agent orchestrator designed to coordinate multiple coding agents using project-management tools.",
          "zh": "OpenAI 已开源 Symphony，这是一种代理协调器，旨在利用项目管理工具协调多个编程代理。"
